;; clj-kondo configuration exported to any project that depends on
;; com.wagoe/wagoe-calendar.
;;
;; `defevent` binds a var and registers the definition. clj-kondo cannot expand
;; the macro from a published jar, so without this every consuming project
;; reports the bound name as an unresolved symbol and has to add the same
;; :lint-as entry to its own .clj-kondo/config.edn by hand (BOU-503).
;;
;; Since `bb check` fails the build on a lint error, that is no longer merely
;; noisy.
{:lint-as {wagoe.calendar.shell.registry/defevent clojure.core/def}}
